flowchart LR
    O[EXISTING restricted mixed source and provenance]
    O --> L[EXISTING exact source or segment labels]
    L --> P[EXISTING explicit removal plan]
    P --> R[REQUIRES APPROVAL independent source-cleared plan review]
    R --> V[EXISTING rebuilt text-only PDF and container validation]
    V --> A[REQUIRES APPROVAL exact senior legal and antitrust decisions when required]
    A --> D[EXISTING separate audience derivative and own anchors]
    D --> F[REQUIRES APPROVAL derivative-backed fact verification and release]
    F --> G[EXISTING organization plus matter gates and current product authority]
    G --> Q[EXISTING bank financial query and derivative-only citation]
    Q --> X[EXISTING protected audit and future revocation]
    L --> STOP[EXISTING deny whole-source legal-advice or prohibited scope]
    N[TARGET DESIGN native Office and layout-preserving redaction] -.-> V
    O -. no original-source corpus access .-> STOP
    classDef existing fill:#ffffff,color:#111111,stroke:#111111;
    classDef target fill:#eeeeee,color:#111111,stroke:#777777,stroke-dasharray:5 5;
    classDef approval fill:#111111,color:#ffffff,stroke:#111111;
    class O,L,P,V,D,G,Q,X,STOP existing;
    class N target;
    class R,A,F approval;
